<section id="l23" class="part item">
<h3><span class="num">Change 23 &middot; revival-changes.md, &ldquo;Reductions and comprehensions&rdquo;</span>What the team's tests do that is not to be copied</h3>
<div class="change solo"><div><span class="side">New text; underlined, the words that changed; struck through, the words that went</span>
